  "description": "Elevate your riding with the Hiboy ECOM Eco Friendly big wheel electric scooter. This electric scooter with seat offers assistance in traveling larger miles with its adjustable seat and removable basket to meet everyone's different needs. It is equipped with a max 450W Motor that takes the speed of this electric scooter up to 22 mph in a few seconds. Its 14-inch big and fat wheels can easily handle 15-degree hills for inclined climbing.\nThe Hiboy ECOM Eco Friendly big wheel electric scooter is the perfect choice when you need to cover short to medium commutes. It has a large 48V 10Ah high-efficiency lithium-ion battery that lasts up to 30 miles. The dual-brake and disc brake features allow a comfortable and smooth ride even on busy roads. With two speed modes, LED headlight, and taillight, the Hiboy ECOM Eco Friendly big wheel electric scooter is perfect for light commuting and travel. Its foldable mechanism helps carry it along anywhere you travel.",
